built-in constraint ⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000006⟫comparable⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000007⟫. ⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000008⟫x⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000009⟫ is also a value of the same type.

⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000010⟫comparable⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000011⟫ is a useful constraint that makes it possible to use the ⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000012⟫==⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000013⟫ and
⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000014⟫!=⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000015⟫ operators on values of the type. In this example, we use it to compare a
